{"lrc":"[00:36.15] It started out as any other story\n[00:39.59] Then the words begin to fade away\n[00:43.60] All your smile used to make me smile\n[00:46.58] But lately I don't feel that way\n[00:51.27] Try to remember what brought us together\n[00:55.25] And to forget what's driving us apart\n[00:59.25] You know we can't wait here forever\n[01:02.57] Just making time and going nowhere\n[01:09.84] Is this our last dance\n[01:12.77] Can we take another chance\n[01:16.53] To be alone together still\n[01:28.40] Are we wasting time chasing dreams?\n[01:30.36] Not yours or mine\n[01:32.80] Care for you\n[01:35.50] I always will\n[01:42.20] We can try to keep the love from fading\n[01:45.23] 'Cuz all we have a reasons to be gone\n[01:49.88] Remember when you used to make me smile\n[01:52.54] But lately I don't feel the same\n[01:57.72] Look up and I see your face\n[02:01.46] I can see you looking back at me\n[02:05.90] Every time I think it's getting better\n[02:08.76] Just making time and going nowhere\n[02:15.39] Is this our last dance\n[02:18.87] Can we take another chance\n[02:22.75] To be alone together still\n[02:31.84] Are we wasting time chasing dreams?\n[02:36.34] Not yours or mine\n[02:39.20] Care for you\n[02:41.52] I always will\n[02:48.64] You know I always will\n[02:57.29] But there's no looking back\n[03:05.30] And no more need to cry\n[03:09.48] No more need to cry\n[03:13.39] No more need to cry\n[03:20.70] Is this all we have?\n[03:22.80] Should we walk away at last\n[03:26.76] To be alone together still\n[03:35.81] Are we wasting time chasing dreams?\n[03:40.27] Not yours or mine\n[03:43.08] Care for you\n[03:45.68] I always will\n[03:53.29] You know I always will\n[04:00.14]\n","timings":{"lines":[{"t":36.26,"e":39.44,"chars":[{"c":"I","s":36.26,"e":36.37},{"c":"t","s":36.37,"e":36.48},{"c":" ","s":36.48,"e":36.48},{"c":"s","s":36.48,"e":36.546},{"c":"t","s":36.546,"e":36.611},{"c":"a","s":36.611,"e":36.677},{"c":"r","s":36.677,"e":36.743},{"c":"t","